#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:73
#: 2c0bac1a4005421b8cf0617d74f75f63
msgid "Assembly is difficult because both upper and lower plates are required to hold the legs in place.  Temporarily use four `5cm (2inch) C-clamps <https://www.amazon.com/C-Clamp-Industrial-Strength-Woodworking-Building/dp/B0BLC44XHT>`__ to hold the lower plate and legs together."
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:74
#: 1c5eae111f5c4675bf3caa7ab3d0fed4
msgid "The ESC wires are too long resulting in messy wiring.  These can be shortened using `solder sleeves <https://www.amazon.com/TICONN-Connectors-Waterproof-Insulated-Electrical/dp/B07GDDKJ1D>`__"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:75
#: a5c4fe8c7d6f4b2d99f3dc547051104c
msgid "If a gimbal is to be used, the battery must be mounted on the top of the vehicle.  Two possible configurations are:"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:77
#: 4b94b94c40364cbd9d3fee40bb6279e7
msgid "Use two smaller batteries mounted on the top of the frame on either side of the autopilot.  Be careful that the two batteries have the same voltage if connected in parallel"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:78
#: 7a30f4ca44e04fdd882677eb6f5fbc4e
msgid "Mount the autopilot between the upper and lower plates allowing a single large batter to be mounted on top of the frame.  Note this will make accessing the autopilot difficult"
msgstr ""

#: ../../source/docs/reference-frames-hexsoon-td650.rst:80
#: 3b19fb56b00c45bdb310c3770704bbdb
msgid "The 30cm battery straps included in the kit are too short.  Replace with 2cm x 50cm velcro battery straps"
msgstr ""

